sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as Client<br/>(Frontend)
    participant FastAPI as FastAPI<br/>Service
    participant Celery as Celery<br/>Worker
    participant Redis as Redis<br/>(Lock, Rate)
    participant PostgreSQL as PostgreSQL<br/>(Messages)
    participant OpenRouter as OpenRouter<br/>API
    participant RabbitMQ as RabbitMQ<br/>(Events)

    Client->>FastAPI: 1. POST /chat/llm/query
    FastAPI->>PostgreSQL: 2. Save user message (SENT)
    FastAPI->>Celery: 3. Send task (llm_request.delay)
    FastAPI-->>Client: 4. 202 Accepted

    Celery->>Redis: 5. Check rate limit
    Redis-->>Celery: 6. Allowed / Limited

    Celery->>Redis: 7. Acquire lock (idempotency)
    Redis-->>Celery: 8. Lock acquired

    Celery->>PostgreSQL: 9. Update status (PROCESSING)

    Celery->>PostgreSQL: 10. Get conversation history
    PostgreSQL-->>Celery: 11. Last 10 messages

    Celery->>OpenRouter: 12. POST /chat/completions
    OpenRouter-->>Celery: 13. LLM response

    Celery->>PostgreSQL: 14. Save assistant message

    Celery->>RabbitMQ: 15. Publish message event
    RabbitMQ-->>Client: 16. WebSocket notification

    Celery->>PostgreSQL: 17. Update status (DELIVERED)

    Celery->>Redis: 18. Release lock
    Redis-->>Celery: 19. Lock released
